# Data Science Fundamentals Assessment

## Overview
This project demonstrates fundamental data science concepts using Python, statistics, data analysis, and visualization.

## Topics Covered
- Python basics, variables, and data types
- Lists, tuples, sets, and dictionaries
- Descriptive statistics
- Probability and correlation
- Data analysis using Pandas and NumPy
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Data visualization using Matplotlib

## Tools Used
- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib

## Objective
To demonstrate an understanding of data science fundamentals and apply Python programming and statistical techniques to analyze data.
